            "title": "Creating",
            "id": 127470,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıf şablonumuzu kullanarak bir şey oluşturmak istediğimizde, burada <code>fluffy</code> gibi bir değişken veya sabit oluşturarak başlarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fluffy =\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>let</code>, ardından <code>fluffy</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Parentheses ",
            "id": 127471,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sonra, burada <code>VirtualPet()</code> örneğinde olduğu gibi, sınıf adını ve parantezleri ekleyerek onu oluştururuz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fluffy = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>VirtualPet</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Instances",
            "id": 127472,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıf şablonundan değişkenler oluşturduğumuzda <strong>örnekler</strong> oluştururuz. <code>fluffy</code> ve <code>benny</code>, <code>VirtualPet</code> sınıfının örnekleridir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fluffy = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" benny = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>let benny</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>VirtualPet()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Definition",
            "id": 127473,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>fluffy</code> değişkenlerini oluşturmak için kullandığımız <code>VirtualPet</code> sınıfına <strong>tanım</strong> denir. <code>VirtualPet</code> tanımdır, <code>fluffy</code> ise bir örnektir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" legs = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lives = \" /><text value=\"&quot;9&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fluffy = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Variable",
            "id": 127474,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sınıf değişkenine erişmek için örnek adını, bir <code>.</code> işaretini ve istediğimiz değişkenin adını ekleriz. Buradaki <code>skippy.waggingTail</code> gibi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" waggingTail = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" skippy = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(skippy.waggingTail)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"119\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>skippy</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>waggingTail</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Other instances",
            "id": 127475,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıf tanımında oluşturduğumuz tüm değişkenlere erişebiliriz. <code>color</code> değişkeninin değerine <code>skippy.color</code> yazarak erişiriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" waggingTail = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" skippy = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(skippy.waggingTail)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(skippy.color)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"139\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"brown\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>skippy.color</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
